      "attack_scenario": "All peers connected before Fulu fork retain stale custody_group_count=0 for up to 30 minutes. matchIntersection filter (line 374-384) computes zero overlap with remoteCustodyGroupCount=0, blocking data column sync network-wide during the critical fork transition window.",
      "checklist_id": "PROP-6a4369e9-inv-049"
    },
    "text": "After a protocol upgrade or fork transition, all peer metadata fields that are semantically redefined by the new protocol version (e.g., custody_group_count becoming meaningful at Fulu) must be refreshed from each connected peer within a bounded time. Stale pre-transition default values (e.g., zero) must not be used for post-transition decisions.",
    "assertion": "forall peer, field in fork_redefined_metadata: time_since_fork_activation() > REFRESH_BOUND => peer.metadata[field] reflects post-fork value, not pre-fork default",
    "covers": "SG-012",
    "severity": "MEDIUM",
    "type": "invariant"
  }
}

